Package: qlipper
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libqt6sql6-sqlite
Description: Lightweight, cross-platform clipboard history applet
 Qlipper keeps track of what you copy and lets you pick a previous
 entry from a searchable, live-filtered system tray menu.
 .
 This build adds copied-image thumbnails backed by a content-addressed
 on-disk cache, SQLite-backed history storage (single-row writes instead
 of rewriting the whole history on every change), an unlimited-history
 option, and per-entry deletion with the Delete key.
